{# feed integration report section (spec feed §7.2).

Renders one feed's structured payload, restoring the legacy feeber format:
- H2: feed title (linked to site_url when present)
- AI summary paragraph (downgrade marker when AI failed)
- ONE outer <details> per feed ("Click to read N entries") wrapping all entries;
  each entry = linked title + per-entry AI analysis paragraph, separated by ---

HTML escaping rules (security critical):
- entry titles / urls are external data → MUST be HTML-escaped with ``| e``
- AI summary / analysis are trusted output → rendered verbatim

The footer is emitted once by the aggregator (``aggregated_report.j2``), not
per section, so each feed does not repeat it.
#}
{% if site_url %}## [{{ feed_title | e }}]({{ site_url | e }})
{% else %}## {{ feed_title | e }}
{% endif %}
{{ summary }}

<details>
<summary>{{ ngettext("Click to read %(count)s entry", "Click to read %(count)s entries", entries|length) % {"count": entries|length} }}</summary>

{% for entry in entries %}
{% if entry.url %}[{{ entry.title | e }}]({{ entry.url | e }})
{% else %}{{ entry.title | e }}
{% endif %}
{% if entry.analysis %}{{ entry.analysis }}
{% else %}{{ _("**AI analysis unavailable for this entry**") }}
{% endif %}
{% if not loop.last %}

---

{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
</details>
